$ pipeline_

  pipeline is an example of a chained group with ``pipeline=True``.
  Each of the three stages returns a basic container value that the
  next stage reads through the read-only ``Context.pipeline_input``
  attribute, without touching ``ctx.obj`` or the stage's CLI arguments.

Usage:

  $ pip install --editable .
  $ pipeline load --path data.csv filter --column kind --keep x summarize
